mpanions of the right - what are the companions of the right?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"56:28","t":"[They will be] among lote trees with thorns removed.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"56:29","t":"And [banana] trees layered [with fruit].","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"56:30","t":"And shade extended.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"56:31","t":"And water poured out","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"56:32","t":"And fruit, abundant [and varied],","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"56:33","t":"Neither limited [to season] nor forbidden,","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"56:34","t":"And [upon] beds raised high.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"56:35","t":"Indeed, We have produced them [i.e., the women of Paradise] in a [new] creation","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"56:36","t":"And made them virgins,","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"56:37","t":"Devoted [to their husbands] and of equal age,","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"56:38","t":"For the companions of the right [who are]","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"56:39","t":"A company of the former peoples","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"56:40","t":"And a company of the later peoples.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"56:41","t":"And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"56:42","t":"[They will be] in scorching fire and scalding water","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"56:43","t":"And a shade of black smoke,","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"56:44","t":"Neither cool nor beneficial.","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"56:45","t":"Indeed they were, before that, indulging in affluence,","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"56:46","t":"And they used to persist in the great violation,","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"56:47","t":"And they used to say, \"When we die and become dust and bones, are we indeed to be resurrected?","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"56:48","t":"And our forefathers [as well]?\"","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"56:49","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Indeed, the former and later peoples","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"56:50","t":"Are to be gathered together for the appointment of a known Day.\"","j":27,"h":54,"s":56,"a":50,"sd":null}],"juz":27,"hizb":54,"surahs":[56],"sajdah":false}